746
00:55:19.666 --> 00:55:22.166
You are not fuckin'
thinkin' straight.

747
00:55:22.168 --> 00:55:23.434
D'you realize what you're doin'?

748
00:55:23.436 --> 00:55:25.336
Yeah, I realize what I'm doin'.

749
00:55:25.338 --> 00:55:28.373
